# trace shows the scheduling of processes over time. The script starts seq in the background and gives its pid to trace. The picture moves with time, so the script is a smoke test that checks that trace opens its window and draws its clock. The key q stops it.
class smoke
window 640x400
run {seq 1 3000000 > /dev/null} & trace $apid
pause 3
snap open
exit "q"
